// 01 - Pipeline runs by status
// Source : workspace monitoring, table ItemJobEventLogs
// Status : RAN LIVE 2026-11-03 (demo workspace)
// Why    : the first "is anything failing?" check. Count runs per status.
// Caveat : each job writes one row per state change (NotStarted, InProgress,
//          then Completed or Failed). Counting rows counts state changes, not
//          runs. Filter to a final state if you want runs.
ItemJobEventLogs
| where ItemKind == "Pipeline"
| summarize count() by JobStatus
